34:["$","pre","pre-0",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"language-text","children":"Developer\r\n   |\r\n   v\r\nGitHub Repository\r\n   |\r\n   v\r\nGitHub Actions — CI\r\n   |\r\n   +--> Lint / Unit Tests\r\n   +--> Secret / Dependency Checks\r\n   +--> Build Docker Image\r\n   +--> Container Vulnerability Scan\r\n   |\r\n   v\r\nProtected Release Gate / Approval\r\n   |\r\n   v\r\nGitHub OIDC --> AWS IAM Role\r\n   |\r\n   +--> Amazon ECR: Versioned Image\r\n   |\r\n   +--> EKS Deployment Workflow\r\n              |\r\n              v\r\n       AWS EKS Cluster\r\n              |\r\n              +--> Kubernetes Deployment\r\n              |       +--> Pod replicas\r\n              |\r\n              +--> Kubernetes Service\r\n              |\r\n              +--> Readiness / Liveness Probes\r\n              |\r\n              +--> Rollout Status / Logs\r\n              |\r\n              v\r\n       Health Check + Release Evidence\n"}]}]
